  "description": "Fair Deal Property, Your Trusted Experts for Residential Property Sales,\n\nAre delighted to present to you for sale this outstanding refurbishment opportunity located in Coolpark, just five minutes from Tuam town.\n\nOccupying an elevated site with views across the open countryside, this three-bedroom bungalow offers a tranquil setting, generous accommodation and considerable potential to create a home tailored to your own tastes and requirements.\n\nExtending to approximately 100 square metres, the residence is in habitable condition but would benefit from substantial refurbishment and modernisation. Double glazing was fitted in 2010 and the window are in good working order.\n\nThe property has been certified as vacant by Galway County Council, providing an opportunity for eligible purchasers to access substantial refurbishment funding through the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, subject to the scheme’s conditions and approval.\n\nOn arrival, you are greeted by a generously proportioned entrance hall leading to the living room, where a large front-facing window frames the countryside view and brings natural light into the space. A feature fireplace provides a focal point for the room.\n\nA spacious dining area flows into the kitchen, which offers scope for a complete redesign and provides access to the rear of the property. The home also features a stove plumbed into the radiators.\n\nAlong the hallway are three double bedrooms, each offering ample floor space and built-in wardrobes. A family bathroom, which also requires refurbishment, completes the accommodation.\n\nThe property comes with a garage of cavity block construction, offering useful additional space and potential for incorporation into the dwelling, subject to the necessary permissions.\n\nFor those seeking a bungalow in a peaceful countryside setting, with the convenience of Tuam town just minutes away, this property offers an exciting opportunity. Its elevated position, spacious layout and refurbishment potential provide an appealing starting point for creating a comfortable modern home.\n\nIf this sounds like the opportunity you have been waiting for, we would be delighted to hear from you, arrange a viewing and help you in any way we can.\n\nBrought to you by Fair Deal Property, Your Trusted Experts for Residential Property Sales.",
